@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Session Analysis Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>Sliding-Window HuBERT-D Inference and Event Aggregation</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE
participant "session_engine" as Engine #EDE9FE
participant "VoxFlowInferenceEngine" as InfEngine #C4B5FD
participant "HubertMultiLabelClassifier" as HubertModel #C4B5FD
participant "event_aggregator" as Aggregator #DDD6FE
participant "session_summary" as Summary #DDD6FE
database "database\n(voxflow.db)" as DB #ECFDF5
participant "Streamlit Dashboard" as UI #DCFCE7

== 1. Audio Validation & Window Slicing ==

API -> Engine : validate_and_load_session_audio(audio_path)
Engine --> API : (audio, sr, duration_sec)

API -> Engine : process_session_windows(session_id, audio, sr, duration_sec, engine)

== 2. Sliding-Window HuBERT-D Multi-Label Inference ==

loop For Each 3.0-Second Audio Window (1.0s hop)
    Engine -> InfEngine : predict_window(waveform, sample_rate)
    InfEngine -> HubertModel : forward(input_values)
    HubertModel --> InfEngine : logits
    InfEngine -> InfEngine : Apply Sigmoids & locked thresholds\n(Rep: 0.77, Pro: 0.79, Blk: 0.57)
    InfEngine --> Engine : probabilities + threshold decisions
end

Engine --> API : windows

== 3. Event Aggregation & Session Summary ==

API -> Aggregator : aggregate_window_events(session_id, windows, min_support_windows=1, merge_gap_sec=1.5)
Aggregator --> API : events

API -> Summary : calculate_session_summary(session_id, duration_sec, windows, events, model_name)
Summary --> API : summary

== 4. Persistence & Dashboard Visualization ==

API -> DB : save_session_record(...)
API -> DB : save_session_analysis(...)
DB --> API : Persisted atomically

API --> API : Return 200 OK response

UI -> DB : get_latest_session() / get_session_details(session_id)
DB --> UI : Stored session summary, windows, events
UI -> UI : Render Summary Metrics, Probability Timeline,\nWindow Audit Table & Event Visualizer

@enduml